[h2]0.1[/h2]
[b]First release.[/b] An add-on for [b]Detailed Map Tacks[/b] by wltk - it patches that mod and does nothing without it.
[list]
[*] Requires Detailed Map Tacks. Declared as a hard dependency, so the fixes simply do not apply if that mod is missing or switched off.
[*] New option under Options - Mods: [b]Apply Detailed Map Tacks fixes[/b], on by default. Turns every fix off without uninstalling this mod - the first thing to try if map tacks misbehave after a Detailed Map Tacks update.
[*] Available in twelve languages.
[/list]
No fixes are shipped in this version yet - it is the groundwork for them.
